.TH VIBEOS-CALENDAR 1 "2026-11-16" "vibeos 0.1.0" "VibeOS"
.SH NAME
vibeos-calendar \- calendar for VibeOS
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B vibeos-calendar
.SH DESCRIPTION
The Etar calendar rebuilt in GTK 4 on evolution-data-server: day, month and agenda views and the event editor. It is D-Bus activatable as vibeos.Calendar; an .ics file given on the command line opens in the editor as a new event.
.SH SEE ALSO
vibeos-calendar-reminders(1)
